{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52217","headline":"颂六十二首 四十二 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 四十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峨峨王舍城，郁郁灵竹园。\n中有神化长，巧诱入幽玄。\n善人募授福，恶友乐雠怨。\n善恶昇沉异，薰莸别路门。\n（见同书同卷《恶交篇》）（按：《古今禅藻集》卷一、《古诗纪》卷一二八收此首爲隋无名释典诗，丁福保、逯钦立皆从之，实误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}